The Registers Read:

Offset   Name        Value             Meaning
0x000  PMC_ID      0x138000a1   GP108, Pascal, TSMC fab
0x200  PMC_ENABLE  0x40002020   Only PIBUS, PDAEMON, PDISPLAY on  //envytools holds most possible combinations
0x100  INTR_HOST   0x00000000   No pending interrupts
